{{Use mdy dates|date=October 2023}}A man's '''[[suit (clothing)|suit]]''' of clothes, in the sense of a lounge, office, business, dinner or dress suit, is a set of garments which are crafted from the same cloth. This article discusses the history of the lounge suit, often called a business suit when featuring dark colors and a conservative cut.

