[[Halloween]] is a celebration observed on [[October 31]], the day before the feast of [[All Saints' Day|All Hallows]], also known as Hallowmas or All Saints' Day. The celebrations and observances of this day occur primarily in regions of the Western world, albeit with some traditions varying significantly between geographical areas.

